      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili Mosi, nindi, Kunashali chipupu chimu chinakaletela Fwaro ni aEjipitu; nkumininaku wakayiitŋa kufumamu; chakayiitijayi kuya wakayishinjeka chakuyishinjeka niwaka shalamu nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoshaku dinu nawantu ami, neyi, Wejima wenu ni amayala niambanda lombenu akwenu mwatuŋa nawu mwamwihi, akayinki niyuma yasiliva yalema niyuma yawuru yalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wayikwashili kulonda akayitiyikuwaha kudi aEjipitu. Ona iyala Mosi waswejeli kulema mwituŋa daEjipitu, ni kumesu awambuŋa Fwaro, ni kumesu awantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi welili nindi, Tiyenu chanahoshiyi Yehova, nindi, Kwakwihi nihakachi kawufuku nakaya mukachi kaEjipitu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyana awedi ejima amwituŋada Ejipitu akafwa, kufumisha hadi wedi waFwaro washakama hetanda dawanta, kushika nikudi wedi wanduŋu yamumbanda watwaŋa kwiyanda; niawedi ejima awayimuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakekala ikumbu dadeni dakudila mwejima mwahita ituŋa daEjipitu, kanda dehi atiyaŋahu dehi antu ikumbu dakudiladidi chochinaku, hela kunyaka yacheŋi hiyamba kaditiya cheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza anyana kaIsarela nikakawa kakayibolahu ntahi, nikamuku nehi, hela kubola muntu hela kubola kanyama; kulonda mwakeluki nenu Yehova naambuli hakachi kawaEjipitu nawaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninawa ambuŋeyi wejimawawu akenza kudami, akanfukamina, akaŋila nawu, Yaŋa kweyi, niantu ejima wudi nawu. Nkumininaku ninami hinakaya. Hakwidika kwindi mwadiŋiyi Fwaro nakuzuwa nankashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
